msgstr "To področje prikazuje nekatere možnosti steze:"

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:314
msgid ""
"|go-down| Expand/collapse the track. :kbd:`Shift+LMB` to expand/collapse all "
"tracks of the same type."
msgstr ""
"|go-down| Razširite/strnite stezo. Držite pritisnjeno dvigalko in kliknite (:"
"kbd:`dvigalka+LGM` ), da razširite ali strnete vse istovrstne steze."

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:316
msgid "Track name. Click on it to enter or change the name of the track."
msgstr "Ime steze. Kliknite sem, da vnesete ali spremenite ime steze."

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:318
msgid "Track type and track number"
msgstr "Vrsta steze in številka steze"

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:320
