#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:431
msgid "Deleting Tracks"
msgstr "Brisanje stez"

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:433
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In order to delete a track right-click anywhere in the track header area. "
#| "In the **Delete Track** dialog window select the tracks you want to "
#| "delete."
msgid ""
"In order to delete a track right-click anywhere in the track header area. In "
"the **Delete Track** dialog window select the tracks you want to delete. "
"Kdenlive warns you if there are clips on the track to be deleted. You can "
"still delete the track and all its clips or cancel the operation."
msgstr ""
"Če želite izbrisati stezo, z desno tipko miške kliknite kamorkoli v območje "
"glave steze. V pogovornem oknu **Izbriši stezo** izberite steze, ki jih "
"želite izbrisati."

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:442
msgid "Resizing Tracks"
msgstr "Spreminjanje velikosti stez"

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:446
msgid ""
"Tracks can be individually resized. Holding down :kbd:`Shift` makes all "
"video or audio tracks change in height simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Stezam je mogoče posamično spremeniti velikost. Držite pritisnjeno :kbd:"
"`dvigalko`, da vse video ali zvočne steze hkrati spremenijo višino."

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:454
msgid "Fit Tracks to view height"
msgstr "Prilagodi višino stez pogledu"

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:458
